        <p> <strong> User Interaction & Dashboard Interface:</strong> </p>
        <ul>
            <li>Farmers input soil parameters (N, P, K, pH) through a simple form </li>
            <li>Weather data is filled in automatically via Weather API </li>
            <li>Leaf image uploads are processed instantly for disease detection </li>
            <li>The dashboard provides all these insights in an easy-to-understand interface. </li>
        </ul>

        <p> <strong>Impact & Benefits:</strong> </p>
        <ul>
            <li>Helps farmers make data-driven crop choices </li>
            <li>Reduces crop failure with early disease detection </li>
            <li>Promotes sustainable and precision farming </li>
        </ul>
        
